From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:53:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 078/207] In-model runner: guide from a boot file or the
 request, per-reply cell counts in the response

TF_DSV41_RUNNER_GUIDE is 1 (RUNNER-GUIDE.md) or a file path, the chats' default guide. A request's
runner_guide string (at most 512 bytes; empty: no guide) overrides it in the same place and is ignored
with the runner off. The response's tensorfold block gains runner (cells per form, owned tokens, owned
cells by program kind, held ms) and runner_guide (sha256, bytes) when the runner is on.
